# LLM Integration Patterns

## PDF Processing Pipeline
When working with PDF ingestion and processing:
- Always validate PDF input before processing
- Use structured chunking strategies for technical content
- Implement proper error handling for malformed PDFs
- Consider memory usage for large documents

## Vector Database Operations
For Qdrant operations:
- Use proper collection naming conventions
- Implement batch operations for embeddings
- Handle vector dimension consistency
- Use proper metadata filtering for retrieval

## LLM Prompt Engineering
For flashcard generation:
- Structure prompts for consistent JSON output
- Include context from retrieved chunks
- Implement retry logic for API failures
- Validate generated content structure

## Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- Implement proper chunk overlap for context
- Use semantic similarity thresholds
- Handle cases where no relevant chunks are found
- Implement fallback strategies for poor retrieval